<section class="wrap band" id="after">
  <div class="shead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;justify-items:center;gap:8px">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--red" data-rv>After you press send</p>
      <h2 class="h2" data-rv style="--d:60ms;max-width:none">No black boxes here either.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="dek" data-rv style="--d:100ms;max-width:none">The same rule we apply to candidates applies to anyone who
    writes to us. <b>You will hear back either way, and quickly enough to be useful.</b></p>
  </div>
  <div class="paths2" data-rv style="--d:140ms">
    <div class="pth">
      <p class="pth__k">If you’re hiring</p>
      <div class="pth__l">
        <div class="pth__s"><span class="pth__d">Same day</span><p class="pth__t">A person reads it</p>
          <p class="pth__x">Abhishek, usually within a few hours of it landing.</p></div>
        <div class="pth__s"><span class="pth__d">Within a day</span><p class="pth__t">A real reply</p>
          <p class="pth__x">Either a time to talk, or an honest no with a reason.</p></div>
        <div class="pth__s"><span class="pth__d">45 minutes</span><p class="pth__t">Intake call</p>
          <p class="pth__x">We learn your yes: the role, the manager, the bar.</p></div>
        <div class="pth__s pth__s--end"><span class="pth__d">36 hours</span><p class="pth__t">Three names</p>
          <p class="pth__x">Scored against the bar we set with you, with the reasoning.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pth">
      <p class="pth__k">If you’re looking</p>
      <div class="pth__l">
        <div class="pth__s"><span class="pth__d">Within two days</span><p class="pth__t">Someone reads it</p>
          <p class="pth__x">Akshata, or a senior expert in your area. Not a screener.</p></div>
        <div class="pth__s"><span class="pth__d">Straight away</span><p class="pth__t">Anonymous</p>
          <p class="pth__x">Nothing is visible to any company until you release it.</p></div>
        <div class="pth__s"><span class="pth__d">Within a week</span><p class="pth__t">Half an hour</p>
          <p class="pth__x">With someone who has run what you run. You keep the score.</p></div>
        <div class="pth__s pth__s--end"><span class="pth__d">Or not</span><p class="pth__t">An honest no</p>
          <p class="pth__x">If we don’t run mandates in your area, we say so on day one.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="nofee" data-rv style="--d:160ms">It costs nothing either way, and there is no fee for
  candidates at any point. Companies pay us when they hire; <em>nobody else ever does.</em></p>
</section>
